      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.41,
          "en": "Now that we got the tabs working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.41,
          "end": 8.16,
          "en": "we can also work on this favorites feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.16,
          "end": 10.11,
          "en": "And for that it should be possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.11,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "to visit this MealDetailsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.65,
          "end": 15.24,
          "en": "And here I want to have a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.24,
          "end": 18.76,
          "en": "that allows me to mark this meal as a favorite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.13,
          "end": 23.61,
          "en": "and to allow users to mark a meal as a item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.61,
          "end": 26.37,
          "en": "I'll go to this meal details dart file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.37,
          "end": 29.07,
          "en": "where we have the MealDetailsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.07,
          "end": 32.91,
          "en": "And there in the app bar I want to add some actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.91,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "or one action to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 38.64,
          "en": "I want to add a icon button as an action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.64,
          "end": 41.733,
          "en": "which can be used to mark a meal as a favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 44.31,
          "en": "Now for that of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.31,
          "end": 47.94,
          "en": "we'll have to do something once this is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 50.7,
          "en": "but then we also have to add a icon here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.7,
          "end": 53.1,
          "en": "and the icon should actually change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.1,
          "end": 57.3,
          "en": "based on whether this meal already is a favorite or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.3,
          "end": 60,
          "en": "For a start, I'll simply create a icon which it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60,
          "end": 64.02,
          "en": "which is set to icons.star.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.02,
          "end": 65.61,
          "en": "And we can set this to const,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.61,
          "end": 68.43299999999999,
          "en": "though we will change this logic later anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.57,
          "end": 73.26,
          "en": "Now with that, we'll have this icon here at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.26,
          "end": 74.22,
          "en": "which is nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.22,
          "end": 76.14,
          "en": "And when we tap this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.14,
          "end": 79.68,
          "en": "this meal here should either be saved as a favorite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 83.25,
          "en": "or should be removed from the favorites list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.25,
          "end": 85.08,
          "en": "And this of course means that we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.08,
          "end": 89.34,
          "en": "to manage some state somewhere in this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.34,
          "end": 93.06,
          "en": "We need to manage a list of meals or meal IDs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.06,
          "end": 97.32,
          "en": "or anything like that that have been marked as a favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.32,
          "end": 99.90299999999999,
          "en": "But where should we manage this list?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.19,
          "end": 104.25,
          "en": "Well, not inside of this MealDetailsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.25,
          "end": 107.4,
          "en": "because if we would manage this state in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.4,
          "end": 111.21000000000001,
          "en": "we would not have access to it from inside other widgets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.21000000000001,
          "end": 113.25,
          "en": "And we do need this information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.25,
          "end": 115.44,
          "en": "which meals are a favorite or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.44,
          "end": 117.81,
          "en": "in the tabs screen, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.81,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "because here we are displaying the MealsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "and we're passing the meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 125.91,
          "en": "that should be rendered on that MealsScreen to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.91,
          "end": 128.28,
          "en": "And since we're rendering the MealsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.28,
          "end": 130.92,
          "en": "as the favorites screen here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.92,
          "end": 135.06,
          "en": "in the end, we want to pass all the favorite meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "to the MealsScreen in this place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 140.82,
          "en": "So therefore, we need access to the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.82,
          "end": 143.57999999999998,
          "en": "which meals are marked as favorites",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.57999999999998,
          "end": 145.743,
          "en": "in this tabs screen widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "Of course, the state is manipulated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 151.86,
          "en": "from inside MealDetails though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.86,
          "end": 153.81,
          "en": "so therefore we'll have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.81,
          "end": 155.7,
          "en": "that we create a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.7,
          "end": 160.7,
          "en": "that adds or removes favorites here in tabs screen state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.74,
          "end": 165.3,
          "en": "but will have to pass this function down to MealDetails",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.3,
          "end": 168.48,
          "en": "so that when this icon button is pressed there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.48,
          "end": 172.17000000000002,
          "en": "we actually change the state in the tabs screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 174.45,
          "en": "So we're lifting the state up in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 177.24,
          "en": "Something we have done many times before in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.24,
          "end": 179.223,
          "en": "and which we will do again here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.18,
          "end": 183.66,
          "en": "So for that here we can add a final list of meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 185.13,
          "en": "and it can be final",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.13,
          "end": 188.25,
          "en": "because we'll never reassign this property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 188.25,
          "end": 190.5,
          "en": "which I'm about to add here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.5,
          "end": 194.22,
          "en": "and this property can be called favorite meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.22,
          "end": 196.68,
          "en": "And initially it's an empty list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.68,
          "end": 199.77,
          "en": "and meal also should be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.77,
          "end": 203.193,
          "en": "so you should add this import from the models folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.23,
          "end": 207.57,
          "en": "So this list is empty initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.57,
          "end": 210.42000000000002,
          "en": "but of course now we can add a new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.42000000000002,
          "end": 214.133,
          "en": "which could be called toggleMealFavoriteStatus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.84,
          "end": 221.04,
          "en": "because this function should either add a meal to the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.04,
          "end": 222.54,
          "en": "or remove the meal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.54,
          "end": 225.003,
          "en": "it should be one function that does both.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.05,
          "end": 230.46,
          "en": "And here I expect to get a meal as a parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.46,
          "end": 232.41,
          "en": "And then in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.41,
          "end": 235.02,
          "en": "we need to find out whether this meal here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 237.18,
          "en": "is already part of this list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.18,
          "end": 238.98,
          "en": "in which case it should be removed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 238.98,
          "end": 239.997,
          "en": "or if it's not part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 239.997,
          "end": 242.103,
          "en": "in which case it should be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.09,
          "end": 245.04,
          "en": "Now we can use different approaches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.04,
          "end": 248.13,
          "en": "to determine whether this meal is part of this list or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.13,
          "end": 252.69,
          "en": "And one simple, straightforward way of determining this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 252.69,
          "end": 256.03,
          "en": "is to add a variable isExisting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.16,
          "end": 261.24,
          "en": "and in this variable I want to store true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.24,
          "end": 264.27,
          "en": "but of course that should be derived dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.27,
          "end": 268.83,
          "en": "which I can do by taking a look at favoriteMeals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.83,
          "end": 270.72,
          "en": "and then calling contains,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.72,
          "end": 274.74,
          "en": "a built-in method that you can call on any list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.74,
          "end": 276.81,
          "en": "to check whether favorite meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.81,
          "end": 279.423,
          "en": "contains this meal, which I'm getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.35,
          "end": 282.63,
          "en": "If it does, this will return true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 282.63,
          "end": 284.58299999999997,
          "en": "otherwise it will return false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 285.84000000000003,
          "end": 289.65,
          "en": "And now we can check if isExisting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 289.65,
          "end": 292.26,
          "en": "is true or as a shortcut,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 292.26,
          "end": 294.51,
          "en": "we can also just write isExisting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 294.51,
          "end": 297.24,
          "en": "since this already stores true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 297.24,
          "end": 299.76,
          "en": "and if once true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 299.76,
          "end": 301.383,
          "en": "so that's all we have to write.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 302.37,
          "end": 305.22,
          "en": "Checking like this would be redundant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 305.22,
          "end": 308.79,
          "en": "So here I'm checking if isExisting is true in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 308.79,
          "end": 311.85,
          "en": "And if it is true, it means we have to remove the meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 311.85,
          "end": 314.97,
          "en": "So in this case, I want to access favoriteMeals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 314.97,
          "end": 317.823,
          "en": "and call remove and remove the meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 318.69,
          "end": 322.23,
          "en": "And otherwise I'll access favoriteMeals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.23,
          "end": 325.713,
          "en": "and call add and add that meal to the favorites.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 326.55,
          "end": 328.5,
          "en": "And this is all we have to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 328.5,
          "end": 332.58,
          "en": "This will make sure that a meal is added or removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.58,
          "end": 334.40999999999997,
          "en": "So now that we have this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 334.40999999999997,
          "end": 337.44,
          "en": "we have to get it to the MealDetailsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 337.44,
          "end": 338.7,
          "en": "because that is in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 338.7,
          "end": 340.08,
          "en": "where it should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 340.08,
          "end": 342.243,
          "en": "when this icon button here is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 343.14,
          "end": 345.84000000000003,
          "en": "The problem of course is that the tabs screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 345.84000000000003,
          "end": 349.86,
          "en": "doesn't have direct access to the MealDetailsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 349.86,
          "end": 353.01,
          "en": "Instead, the tabs screen only has access to the categories",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 353.01,
          "end": 354.243,
          "en": "and MealsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 355.26,
          "end": 358.12,
          "en": "But both these screens ultimately reach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 358.12,
          "end": 359.523,
          "en": "the MealDetailsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 360.63,
          "end": 362.52,
          "en": "I mean inside of the MealsScreen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 362.52,
          "end": 366.51,
          "en": "we simply do push the MealDetailsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 366.51,
          "end": 369.15,
          "en": "So here we could pass a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 369.15,
          "end": 372.45,
          "en": "to this toggleMealFavoriteStatus function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 372.45,
          "end": 374.133,
          "en": "to the MealDetailsScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 375.18,
          "end": 379.08,
          "en": "But in order to be able to pass a pointer to this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 379.08,
          "end": 382.59,
          "en": "to the MealDetailsScreen from inside the MealsScreen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 382.59,
          "end": 386.19,
          "en": "we first have to pass this function from the tabs screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 386.19,
          "end": 387.84,
          "en": "to the MealsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 387.84,
          "end": 389.91,
          "en": "and later as a second step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 389.91,
          "end": 393.57,
          "en": "also through the CategoriesScreen to the MealsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 393.57,
          "end": 397.62,
          "en": "because that's another place where the MealsScreen is used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 397.62,
          "end": 400.98,
          "en": "And of course, passing a pointer to a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 400.98,
          "end": 403.35,
          "en": "through multiple layers of widgets like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
